#: ../../tools/migrations/windows_2022.rst:2
msgid "Windows Migration"
msgstr "Migração Windows"

#: ../../tools/migrations/windows_2022.rst:4
msgid ""
"Migrating Windows workloads from VMware vCenter to HVM Clusters is fully "
"supported with automated VirtIO driver injection. The migration system "
"handles driver installation and disk bus conversion automatically in most"
" cases."
msgstr "A migração de workloads Windows do VMware vCenter para Clusters HVM é totalmente suportada com injeção automatizada de drivers VirtIO. O sistema de migração trata da instalação de drivers e da conversão do bus de disco automaticamente na maioria dos casos."

#: ../../tools/migrations/windows_2022.rst:7
msgid "Automated Driver Injection"
msgstr "Injeção Automatizada de Drivers"

#: ../../tools/migrations/windows_2022.rst:9
msgid ""
"When a Windows VM is included in a Migration Plan, the system "
"automatically:"
msgstr "Quando uma VM Windows é incluída em um Migration Plan, o sistema automaticamente:"

#: ../../tools/migrations/windows_2022.rst:11
msgid ""
"**Installs VirtIO guest tools** on the source VM during the Prepare phase"
" (via network download of the MSI package)"
msgstr "**Instala as VirtIO guest tools** na VM de origem durante a fase Prepare (via download pela rede do pacote MSI)"

#: ../../tools/migrations/windows_2022.rst:12
msgid ""
"If network installation fails, **falls back to ISO-based installation** —"
" the VirtIO ISO is uploaded to the VMware datastore, mounted to the VM, "
"and drivers are installed via ``msiexec``"
msgstr "Se a instalação pela rede falhar, **faz fallback para instalação baseada em ISO** — o ISO VirtIO é enviado ao datastore VMware, montado na VM, e os drivers são instalados via ``msiexec``"

#: ../../tools/migrations/windows_2022.rst:13
msgid ""
"**Creates the target VM with temporary SATA disks** so Windows can boot "
"without VirtIO drivers"
msgstr "**Cria a VM de destino com discos SATA temporários** para que o Windows possa inicializar sem drivers VirtIO"

#: ../../tools/migrations/windows_2022.rst:14
msgid ""
"**Adds a small VirtIO helper disk** that triggers Windows to detect and "
"load VirtIO drivers from the driver store"
msgstr "**Adiciona um pequeno disco auxiliar VirtIO** que aciona o Windows a detectar e carregar os drivers VirtIO do driver store"

#: ../../tools/migrations/windows_2022.rst:15
msgid ""
"**Boots the target VM** and waits for Windows to register the VirtIO "
"drivers (up to 10 minutes)"
msgstr "**Inicializa a VM de destino** e aguarda o Windows registrar os drivers VirtIO (até 10 minutos)"

#: ../../tools/migrations/windows_2022.rst:16
msgid ""
"**Shuts down and switches all disks to VirtIO bus** — SCSI disks map to "
"VirtIO-SCSI, IDE/SATA disks map to VirtIO Block"
msgstr "**Desliga e alterna todos os discos para o bus VirtIO** — discos SCSI mapeiam para VirtIO-SCSI, discos IDE/SATA mapeiam para VirtIO Block"

#: ../../tools/migrations/windows_2022.rst:17
msgid "**Removes the helper disk and ISO volumes**, then starts the final VM"
msgstr "**Remove o disco auxiliar e os volumes ISO**, depois inicia a VM final"

#: ../../tools/migrations/windows_2022.rst:19
msgid ""
"This entire process is handled by the Reconfigure phase and requires no "
"manual intervention for supported Windows versions."
msgstr "Todo este processo é tratado pela fase Reconfigure e não exige intervenção manual para versões Windows suportadas."

#: ../../tools/migrations/windows_2022.rst:22
msgid "Supported Windows Versions"
msgstr "Versões Windows Suportadas"

#: ../../tools/migrations/windows_2022.rst:24
msgid "Windows Server 2016"
msgstr "Windows Server 2016"

#: ../../tools/migrations/windows_2022.rst:25
msgid "Windows Server 2019"
msgstr "Windows Server 2019"

#: ../../tools/migrations/windows_2022.rst:26
msgid "Windows Server 2022"
msgstr "Windows Server 2022"

#: ../../tools/migrations/windows_2022.rst:27
msgid "Windows Server 2025"
msgstr "Windows Server 2025"

#: ../../tools/migrations/windows_2022.rst:28
msgid "Windows 10"
msgstr "Windows 10"

#: ../../tools/migrations/windows_2022.rst:29
msgid "Windows 11"
msgstr "Windows 11"

#: ../../tools/migrations/windows_2022.rst:32
msgid "Manual Preparation (Fallback)"
msgstr "Preparação Manual (Fallback)"

#: ../../tools/migrations/windows_2022.rst:34
msgid ""
"In rare cases where automated driver injection fails (e.g., restricted "
"network access and no VirtIO ISO available in vCenter), you may need to "
"manually prepare the Windows VM before migration. The steps below cover "
"manual VirtIO driver injection for a Windows VM running on vCenter."
msgstr "Em casos raros em que a injeção automatizada de drivers falha (por exemplo, acesso de rede restrito e nenhum ISO VirtIO disponível no vCenter), você pode precisar preparar manualmente a VM Windows antes da migração. As etapas abaixo cobrem a injeção manual de drivers VirtIO para uma VM Windows em execução no vCenter."

#: ../../tools/migrations/windows_2022.rst:36
#: ../../tools/migrations/windows_2022.rst:104
msgid "Note"
msgstr "Nota"

#: ../../tools/migrations/windows_2022.rst:38
msgid ""
"Try the automated process first. Manual preparation is only needed if the"
" migration fails during the Prepare or Reconfigure phases."
msgstr "Tente o processo automatizado primeiro. A preparação manual só é necessária se a migração falhar durante as fases Prepare ou Reconfigure."

#: ../../tools/migrations/windows_2022.rst:40
msgid "Prerequisites for manual preparation:"
msgstr "Pré-requisitos para preparação manual:"

#: ../../tools/migrations/windows_2022.rst:42
msgid "The VM is configured with EFI or BIOS boot"
msgstr "A VM está configurada com boot EFI ou BIOS"

#: ../../tools/migrations/windows_2022.rst:43
msgid ""
"The VM has access to the recovery partition (or Windows Recovery "
"Environment media)"
msgstr "A VM tem acesso à partição de recuperação (ou mídia do Windows Recovery Environment)"

#: ../../tools/migrations/windows_2022.rst:44
msgid ""
"The `VirtIO drivers ISO <https://fedorapeople.org/groups/virt/virtio-win"
"/direct-downloads/latest-virtio/>`_ is available"
msgstr "O `VirtIO drivers ISO <https://fedorapeople.org/groups/virt/virtio-win/direct-downloads/latest-virtio/>`_ está disponível"

#: ../../tools/migrations/windows_2022.rst:46
msgid "**Step 1: Boot into Windows Recovery Environment**"
msgstr "**Passo 1: Inicializar no Windows Recovery Environment**"

#: ../../tools/migrations/windows_2022.rst:48
msgid ""
"Restart the VM into Windows RE. Select a keyboard layout if prompted, "
"then choose :menuselection:`Troubleshoot --> Command Prompt`."
msgstr "Reinicie a VM no Windows RE. Selecione um layout de teclado se solicitado e, em seguida, escolha :menuselection:`Troubleshoot --> Command Prompt`."

#: ../../tools/migrations/windows_2022.rst:50
msgid "**Step 2: Load storage drivers (if disks not visible)**"
msgstr "**Passo 2: Carregar drivers de armazenamento (se os discos não estiverem visíveis)**"

#: ../../tools/migrations/windows_2022.rst:52
msgid "In the Command Prompt, check disk visibility::"
msgstr "No Command Prompt, verifique a visibilidade dos discos::"

#: ../../tools/migrations/windows_2022.rst:54
#: ../../tools/migrations/windows_2022.rst:70
msgid ""
"diskpart\n"
"list disk"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/migrations/windows_2022.rst:57
msgid "Enter diskpart command line tool and list disks"
msgstr "Entre na ferramenta de linha de comando diskpart e liste os discos"

#: ../../tools/migrations/windows_2022.rst:57
msgid ".. image:: /images/migrations/windows_diskpart_list.png"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/migrations/windows_2022.rst:60
msgid ""
"If no disks appear, mount VMware Tools from vCenter "
"(:menuselection:`Actions --> Guest OS --> Install VMware Tools...`), then"
" load the storage driver::"
msgstr "Se nenhum disco aparecer, monte o VMware Tools a partir do vCenter (:menuselection:`Actions --> Guest OS --> Install VMware Tools...`) e, em seguida, carregue o driver de armazenamento::"

#: ../../tools/migrations/windows_2022.rst:62
msgid "list volume"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/migrations/windows_2022.rst:64
msgid "Note the CD-ROM drive letter (e.g., \"D\"), then::"
msgstr "Anote a letra da unidade do CD-ROM (por exemplo, \"D\") e, em seguida::"

#: ../../tools/migrations/windows_2022.rst:66
msgid ""
"drvload \"D:\\Program Files\\VMware\\VMware "
"Tools\\Drivers\\pvscsi\\Win10\\amd64\\pvscsi.inf\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/migrations/windows_2022.rst:68
msgid "Verify disks are now visible::"
msgstr "Verifique se os discos agora estão visíveis::"

#: ../../tools/migrations/windows_2022.rst:73
msgid "Listing volumes in diskpart"
msgstr "Listando volumes no diskpart"

#: ../../tools/migrations/windows_2022.rst:73
msgid ".. image:: /images/migrations/windows_list_volumes.png"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/migrations/windows_2022.rst:76
msgid "Assign drive letters if needed::"
msgstr "Atribua letras de unidade se necessário::"

#: ../../tools/migrations/windows_2022.rst:78
msgid ""
"list volume\n"
"select volume 1\n"
"assign letter=c\n"
"exit"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/migrations/windows_2022.rst:83
msgid "Assigning a drive letter to a volume"
msgstr "Atribuindo uma letra de unidade a um volume"

#: ../../tools/migrations/windows_2022.rst:83
msgid ".. image:: /images/migrations/windows_assign_drive.png"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/migrations/windows_2022.rst:86
msgid "Unmount VMware Tools from vCenter when done."
msgstr "Desmonte o VMware Tools do vCenter quando terminar."

#: ../../tools/migrations/windows_2022.rst:88
msgid "**Step 3: Inject VirtIO drivers**"
msgstr "**Passo 3: Injetar drivers VirtIO**"

#: ../../tools/migrations/windows_2022.rst:90
msgid ""
"Upload the VirtIO ISO to a vCenter datastore or Content Library. Mount it"
" to the VM via a CD-ROM device. Then inject the storage drivers::"
msgstr "Envie o ISO VirtIO para um datastore do vCenter ou Content Library. Monte-o na VM via um dispositivo CD-ROM. Em seguida, injete os drivers de armazenamento::"

#: ../../tools/migrations/windows_2022.rst:92
msgid "dism /image:C:\\ /add-driver:D:\\viostor\\2k22\\amd64\\viostor.inf"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/migrations/windows_2022.rst:94
msgid "Installing viostor.inf driver"
msgstr "Instalando o driver viostor.inf"

#: ../../tools/migrations/windows_2022.rst:94
msgid ".. image:: /images/migrations/windows_viostor_install.png"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/migrations/windows_2022.rst:99
msgid "dism /image:C:\\ /add-driver:D:\\vioscsi\\2k22\\amd64\\vioscsi.inf"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/migrations/windows_2022.rst:101
msgid "Installing vioscsi.inf driver"
msgstr "Instalando o driver vioscsi.inf"

#: ../../tools/migrations/windows_2022.rst:101
msgid ".. image:: /images/migrations/windows_vioscsi_install.png"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/migrations/windows_2022.rst:106
msgid ""
"Replace ``2k22`` with the appropriate directory for your Windows version "
"(e.g., ``2k19``, ``2k16``, ``w10``, ``w11``). Adjust drive letters to "
"match your environment."
msgstr "Substitua ``2k22`` pelo diretório apropriado para sua versão do Windows (por exemplo, ``2k19``, ``2k16``, ``w10``, ``w11``). Ajuste as letras de unidade para corresponder ao seu ambiente."

#: ../../tools/migrations/windows_2022.rst:108
msgid "Close Command Prompt and click **Continue** to boot Windows normally."
msgstr "Feche o Command Prompt e clique em **Continue** para inicializar o Windows normalmente."

#: ../../tools/migrations/windows_2022.rst:110
msgid "**Step 4: Install VirtIO guest tools**"
msgstr "**Passo 4: Instalar VirtIO guest tools**"

#: ../../tools/migrations/windows_2022.rst:112
msgid ""
"Once logged back into Windows, navigate to the mounted VirtIO ISO and "
"install:"
msgstr "Após fazer login novamente no Windows, navegue até o ISO VirtIO montado e instale:"

#: ../../tools/migrations/windows_2022.rst:114
msgid "``virtio-win-gt-x64.msi``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/migrations/windows_2022.rst:115
msgid "``virtio-win-guest-tools.exe``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/migrations/windows_2022.rst:117
msgid ""
"Keep all default selections. After installation, unmount any ISOs "
"attached to the VM."
msgstr "Mantenha todas as seleções padrão. Após a instalação, desmonte quaisquer ISOs anexados à VM."

#: ../../tools/migrations/windows_2022.rst:119
msgid "**Step 5: Power down and migrate**"
msgstr "**Passo 5: Desligar e migrar**"

#: ../../tools/migrations/windows_2022.rst:121
msgid ""
"Shut down the VM and ensure it stays powered off (note that the VMware "
"Cloud integration may have \"AUTOMATICALLY POWER ON VMS\" enabled — if "
"so, shut down from the product UI or temporarily disable that setting). "
"The VM is now ready to be included in a Migration Plan."
msgstr "Desligue a VM e assegure que ela permaneça desligada (observe que a integração da Nuvem VMware pode ter \"AUTOMATICALLY POWER ON VMS\" habilitado — se for o caso, desligue pela UI do produto ou desative temporariamente essa configuração). A VM agora está pronta para ser incluída em um Migration Plan."

#: ../../tools/migrations/windows_2022.rst:124
msgid "Post-Migration: VMware Tools Cleanup"
msgstr "Pós-Migração: Limpeza do VMware Tools"

#: ../../tools/migrations/windows_2022.rst:126
msgid ""
"After migration, VMware Tools remains installed but is non-functional on "
"HVM. To prevent startup errors:"
msgstr "Após a migração, o VMware Tools permanece instalado, mas não é funcional no HVM. Para evitar erros de inicialização:"

#: ../../tools/migrations/windows_2022.rst:128
msgid ""
"Navigate to :menuselection:`Settings --> Apps --> Startup` in the Windows"
" guest and disable **VMware Tools Core Service**"
msgstr "Navegue até :menuselection:`Settings --> Apps --> Startup` no guest Windows e desative **VMware Tools Core Service**"

#: ../../tools/migrations/windows_2022.rst:130
msgid "Turning off VMware Tools Core Service at Windows guest startup"
msgstr "Desativando o VMware Tools Core Service na inicialização do guest Windows"

#: ../../tools/migrations/windows_2022.rst:130
msgid ".. image:: /images/migrations/windows_disable_vmtools.png"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/migrations/windows_2022.rst:133
msgid ""
"Optionally, fully uninstall VMware Tools using Microsoft's `program "
"removal troubleshooter <https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/topic/fix-"
"problems-that-block-programs-from-being-installed-or-removed-"
"cca7d1b6-65a9-3d98-426b-e9f927e1eb4d>`_"
msgstr "Opcionalmente, desinstale completamente o VMware Tools usando o `program removal troubleshooter <https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/topic/fix-problems-that-block-programs-from-being-installed-or-removed-cca7d1b6-65a9-3d98-426b-e9f927e1eb4d>`_ da Microsoft"

